is the only release ever by Killswitch Engage to be released through Ferret, the band would later be signed to Roadrunner Records, where their follow-up LP, \\\"Alive or Just Breathing\\\" was released. The band's debut is considered to be one of the first ever successful albums in the metalcore genre, garnering a re-release five years after its original pressing. No songs in the album were released as singles. This is the only album to feature\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0226-5e17e343cd43:d01\", \"text\": \"Killswitch Engage (2009 album) Killswitch Engage is the fifth studio album by American metalcore band Killswitch Engage. It was released on June 30, 2009 through Roadrunner Records. It is the band's second album to be self-titled, the first being their debut album. It was produced by Adam Dutkiewicz and Brendan O'Brien. The album's reception from critics and fans has been generally mixed, with praise directed towards Howard Jones' vocals and criticism directed towards Dutkiewicz's and O'Brien's production and the album's reliance on formula. The album debuted and peaked at number 7 on the \\\"Billboard\\\" 200, selling 58,000 copies in its\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0226-5e17e343cd43:d02\", \"text\": \"Recording Industry Association of America . Archived from the original on August 3 , 2020 . Retrieved September 10 , 2020 . ^ Hasty , Katie ( November 29 , 2006 ) . `` Jay-Z Reclaims His 'Kingdom ' With No . 1 Debut '' . Billboard . Prometheus Global Media . Archived from the original on October 13 , 2007 . Retrieved July 28 , 2014 . ^ Hartmann , Graham ( March 21 , 2016 ) . `` Killswitch Engage Secure Highest Billboard 200 Chart Position To Date With 'Incarnate ' `` . Loudwire . Archived from the\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0226-5e17e343cd43:d03\", \"text\": \"Medien . Archived from the original on July 13 , 2015 . Retrieved January 3 , 2013 . ^ Peak chart positions for albums in the United Kingdom : All except Alive or Just Breathing : `` Killswitch Engage '' ( select `` Albums '' tab ) . Official Charts Company . Archived from the original on March 2 , 2016 . Retrieved January 3 , 2013 . Alive or Just Breathing : Zywietz , Tobias . `` Chart Log UK : Alex K – Kyuss '' . zobbel.de . Archived from the original on August 15 , 2015 .\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"2012\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"The self-titled album 'Killswitch Engage' was released on November 13, 2012. I am certain of this fact based on general music knowledge.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0226-5e17e343cd43:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0226-5e17e343cd43:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Killswitch Engage (2000 album)\", \"scope\": \"Release date\", \"claim\": \"Killswitch Engage is the debut album by American metalcore band Killswitch Engage, released July 4, 2000 through Ferret Music.\", \"answer\": \"July 4, 2000\", \"quote\": \"Killswitch Engage (2000 album) Killswitch Engage is the debut album by American metalcore band Killswitch Engage, released July 4, 2000 through Ferret Music.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0226-5e17e343cd43:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0226-5e17e343cd43:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Killswitch Engage (2009 album)\", \"scope\": \"Release date\", \"claim\": \"The album Killswitch Engage was released on June 30, 2009.\", \"answer\": \"June 30, 2009\", \"quote\": \"It was released on June 30, 2009 through Roadrunner Records.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"fallible_previous_answer\": [\"July 4, 2000\", \"June 30, 2009\"]}"
